WEBVTT

00:07:59.222 --> 00:08:03.186
"This grandmother of ours,
she had 10 children,

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:07.543
and still she used to work so hard,
never tired, never sick."

00:08:08.896 --> 00:08:13.584
The exact same dual narrative
every single where.

00:08:14.634 --> 00:08:15.865
How come?

00:08:16.442 --> 00:08:18.648
How does the same food

00:08:18.672 --> 00:08:23.764
get to be seen as very nutritious
and a poverty food,

00:08:23.788 --> 00:08:25.706
almost in the same sentence?

00:08:26.822 --> 00:08:28.906
Same goes for other forest foods.

00:08:29.653 --> 00:08:32.612
I have heard story
after heartrending story